This is an implementation of the quaternary model presented in the PhD thesis of
Robert Berman 1983.

https://open.library.ubc.ca/soa/cIRcle/collections/ubctheses/831/items/1.0052362

with one small typo fix of the S A M M value of the Margules coefficents. In
Beckett's code (and Yoneda's), the correct numbers are printed. Error found and
corrected by Denton Ebel in his implementation of the Berman 1983 model, see
https://research.amnh.org/~debel/vapors1/codes/B83a/B83acts1.txt

The Berman 1983 model describes the system SiO2, MgO, CaO, Al2O3. 

2026-03-15
